# Root-level ignore for anyone building an image from the repository root.
# Each app also has its own .dockerignore for the compose builds.
.git
.venv
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/data
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
docs
scripts
*.md
!README.md
